+# Postgres Patroni Migration & Backup/Restore Playbook
+
+1. Deploy patroni helm chart (helm/postgres-patroni) into `aegis` namespace.
+2. Create secret `aegis-postgres-secret` (template in helm/langgraph above).
+3. Run migrations job: kubectl apply -f ops/langgraph/helm/templates/migration-job-patroni.yaml
+4. Verify tables: connect to DB and run SELECT COUNT(*) FROM plans;
+
+Backups:
+ - Deploy ops/db/pg_backup_cronjob.yaml with S3_URI set.
+ - Verify backups appear in S3 and keep retention policy.
+
+Restore:
+ - Use ops/db/restore_postgres.sh with BACKUP_FILE env pointing to s3://.../file.sql.gz and DATABASE_URL to target DB.
+ - After restore, run lightweight consistency checks and run migrate_postgres.py if needed.
+
+Audit:
+ - Record evidence manifests during migration/backup/restore steps using ops/sdk/evidence_sdk.record_manifest
